An empty list from /status means no table currently has a confirmed, fresh status. The dashboard treats any table missing from the list as unknown and clears its old display.
Room totals
The detector can also report room-wide numbers to POST /update/room: people_in_frame (people visible now) and people_so_far (unique visitors today, which the detector deduplicates itself). Either value can be null if the detector can't measure it. The backend does not add up frame counts to estimate visitors, and the last room update expires after 30 seconds.
Write protection
If TOPA_WRITE_TOKEN is set before the server starts, every write route (/update, /update/batch, /update/room and /upload) requires the header Authorization: Bearer <token>. Reading /status stays open, so phones can view the dashboard without a token. This stops other people on a shared Wi-Fi network from sending fake updates.
